    Recognise Act 26 pre-landing records in suite compliance checker
    
    Accept valid act26-prelanding-record/v1 state receipts as a third
    compliance source when the exact commit/tree/parent/main base match,
    commands and content assertions are complete, verdict is pass with no
    explicit failure status, board pin chronology is consistent, canonical
    SHA-256 matches the detached digest, and Git-anchored postlanding copies
    match the state receipt. Preserve batched lookups and wall_seconds
    reporting.

